<div class="mandarin-hanzi">晚上</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">wǎnshang</div>

''Meaning:'' evening; at night  
''Part of speech:'' noun; time word

!! In context
晚上我们在家吃饭。 — Wǎnshang wǒmen zài jiā chī fàn. — We eat at home in the evening.

!! Usage note
A time expression for 'evening' or 'at night'. The second syllable is commonly neutral.
